WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:07.839
I know you're gonna be blown away by this,
but we're going to have to talk about free

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:08.839
speech today.

00:00:08.839 --> 00:00:13.309
It'd be nice if a week would pass by when
we didn't have to talk about a threat to freedom

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:18.990
of speech, but it seems almost every day there
is a new outrage on the horizon aimed at chipping

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.400
away our right to free expression.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.770
There are three specific happenings right
now that I want to focus on, in no particular

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:26.770
order.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:31.119
First, there's the ongoing saga of Bret Weinstein
at Evergreen University in Washington.

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:35.910
In case you missed our livestream with Bret
last week, he is being attacked by being called

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:42.070
a racist and a bigot for opposing a day in
which white students wouldn't be welcome on

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.250
campus.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:50.149
Bret claimed the revised Day of Absence on
campus based on racial segregation was not

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:56.190
just racist and bigoted, but was the complete
reverse of what the day was supposed to stand

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.190
for.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:03.760
Bret has been a progressive his whole life,
but even he is not immune to the toxic ideology

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:10.500
of Leftism, which rates victimhood as virtue
and will swallow anyone who dares deviate

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.540
from it's authoritarian rule.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:18.610
The campus was closed due to threats of violence
and even now Bret is getting no backing from

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:23.830
the administration, which appears to be bending
to the demands of the crazed mob.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:28.880
Even worse, mainstream media is basically
all but ignoring this story because it so

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.729
shatters the regressive ideology.

00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:36.040
Mainstream, left leaning outlets don't want
to touch this story because they don't want

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.890
to be tarred the same way Bret is.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:45.130
Thus, almost all the coverage of the Evergreen
story has been from right leaning websites.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:51.080
Bret has done three live interviews, one right
here, one on Joe Rogan's podcast and one with

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.350
Tucker Carlson on Fox News.

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:59.390
He hasn't been invited on CNN, MSNBC or NPR
and none of those outlets have even written

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.720
a piece on the story.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:07.009
When you hear trust in mainstream media is
at an all time-low, it's reasons like ignoring

00:02:07.009 --> 00:02:11.819
hugely relevant stories that go against their
narrative that are part of the reason.

00:02:11.819 --> 00:02:17.580
The next story of the last few days was the
outrage over Kathy Griffin's ISIS inspired

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:22.420
photos holding up President Trump's decapitated,
bloody head.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.660
First off, on the free speech front, I fully
support Kathy's right to take these pictures

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.090
and make art as she sees fit.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:34.900
I don't think these photos are a direct call
to violence, which would be a crime, and the

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:39.750
pictures should be seen through the lense
that she is a comedian and a provocateur,

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:44.200
regardless of whether you think the images
are in poor taste or just outright awful.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:51.260
So, while it is 100% in her right to make
the images, it is also 100% in CNN's right,

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:54.720
as her employer to fire her if they see it
fit.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:59.599
Now interestingly, in this case, it was the
right calling for CNN to fire Griffin and

00:02:59.599 --> 00:03:04.470
it was the Left that was defending her, though
in this case less people came to her defense

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:05.470
than usual.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.610
While this is a flip on the script of the
last few years, it's important to remember

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:13.570
it seems people only hold their own values
when it's easy to do so.

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:17.959
Just imagine if it had been a conservative
comedian like Tim Allen holding up a severed

00:03:17.959 --> 00:03:20.010
head of President Obama.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:23.650
The Left would've been demanding his show
be cancelled and the right would've been defending

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.650
him.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.769
Ironically, Tim Allen's highly rated show
was cancelled a few weeks ago and many people

00:03:28.769 --> 00:03:34.160
think it is at least partially because he's
been outspoken about being a conservative

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.780
in Hollywood.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.830
The final story I want to touch on is the
outrage over Bill Maher using the N word on

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.450
Real Time last Friday.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:46.010
I can't even repeat what Bill Maher said,
because even just by quoting him I'll end

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:50.909
up in hot water, which shows you how insane
the language police have gotten.

00:03:50.909 --> 00:03:54.269
Basically he made a joke using the N word,
and all hell broke loose.

00:03:54.269 --> 00:04:00.160
To be clear, he didn't use the N word to describe
anyone in particular or take a racist position,

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:05.159
it was a line, that I suspect was prepackaged
to illicit a reaction from the crowd.

00:04:05.159 --> 00:04:10.659
It not only elicited a reaction from the crowd
but also the bigoteer brigade which immediately

00:04:10.659 --> 00:04:13.790
began calling for his firing from HBO.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:18.900
I even saw comedians I know calling for him
to be fired over a joke.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:24.330
This is Bill Maher, who many of you who lean
right absolutely hate, and now the Left was

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.830
doing your job of trying to destroy him.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:31.159
Sadly the Left has been coming for Bill for
a long time mainly because he isn't afraid

00:04:31.159 --> 00:04:35.919
of talking about radical Islam, which has
set him apart from most on the Left.

00:04:35.919 --> 00:04:37.699
I know a little something about that myself.

00:04:37.699 --> 00:04:44.289
HBO took the joke out of repeats of the show
and so far has withstood calls to fire him

00:04:44.289 --> 00:04:49.460
and Maher even apologized, something he has
chastized others for doing in the past.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:54.009
Senator Al Franken cancelled an appearance
on Real Time for this week, despite being

00:04:54.009 --> 00:04:57.030
a friend of Bill and the show for years.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:02.130
I've invited Senator Franken on the show to
discuss, but I won't hold my breath.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.210
So there you have it.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:08.819
A professor bullied off campus by threats
of violence for fighting against racism.

00:05:08.819 --> 00:05:16.090
A comedian fired for a tasteless gag and another
comic under the threat of firing for a joke.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:20.240
None of these are threats to the first amendment,
which as you know is the government coming

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:25.370
for speech, but all add up the chill factor
around freedom of expression that I've been

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:28.089
talking about for quite some time.

00:05:28.089 --> 00:05:33.349
If you were a professor would you be willing
to explore a controversial idea with students

00:05:33.349 --> 00:05:35.169
after what's happened to Bret?

00:05:35.169 --> 00:05:40.029
If you were an artist would you be willing
to paint a controversial painting after what's

00:05:40.029 --> 00:05:41.089
happened to Kathy?

00:05:41.089 --> 00:05:45.339
And if you were a comic would you be willing
to tell an offensive joke after what's happening

00:05:45.339 --> 00:05:46.460
to Bill?

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:51.680
If you answered no to any of these then you
must acknowledge that the threat to free expression

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:52.969
is real.

00:05:52.969 --> 00:05:54.199
Don't like Bret?

00:05:54.199 --> 00:05:55.349
Don't take his class.

00:05:55.349 --> 00:05:58.800
Think Kathy is crass, watch something else
on New Years.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.909
Don't think Bill is funny?

00:05:59.909 --> 00:06:01.529
Change the channel.

00:06:01.529 --> 00:06:05.879
But whatever you do, keep watching The Rubin
Report, because we've got Jason Whitlock from

00:06:05.879 --> 00:06:08.289
Fox Sports 1 on the show this week.

00:06:08.289 --> 00:06:13.629
He was in his own outrageapalooza last week
with calls for him to be fired too, but I'll

00:06:13.629 --> 00:06:14.549
save that for our chat.

